{"id":"appui","lemma":"appui","pos":"noun","rank":4899,"glosses":["support"],"ipa":"/a.pɥi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/01/Fr-appui.ogg/Fr-appui.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"appuis"},"formAudio":{"appuis":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-appuis.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Tu as tout notre appui.","en":"You have our full support.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"our"},null]},{"text":"Vous pouvez compter sur mon appui.","en":"You can count on my support.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to count"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Il a l'appui d'un certain politicien.","en":"He has the backing of a certain politician.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"certain, guaranteed"},{"g":"politician"}]},{"text":"Je sais que Tom apportera son appui.","en":"I know Tom will be supportive.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"that / what"},null,{"g":"to bring","l":"apporter"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"Il jouit de l'appui d'un certain politicien.","en":"He has the backing of a certain politician.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to enjoy","l":"jouir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"certain, guaranteed"},{"g":"politician"}]}]}